      "id": 487501,
      "username": "Sanjesh",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:21:52.785Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li><strong>Go to Property Setter</strong>:<br>\nCreate to <strong>New</strong> <strong>Property Setter</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Select Applied On</strong>:<br>\nChoose <strong>DocField</strong> .</li>\n<li><strong>Select Module</strong>:<br>\nFrom the <strong>Module</strong> dropdown, select your desired module.</li>\n<li><strong>Select Applied</strong>:<br>\nChoose <strong>System Settings</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Fill the Field Name</strong>:<br>\nenter <code>number_format</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Fill the Property</strong>:<br>\nenter <code>options</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Set the Value</strong>:<br>\nenter <code># ###,###</code>.</li>\n<li>Save it</li>\n<li>After that, go to System Settings to select the number format.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If you have any doubts, please refer to the image below for further clarification.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/c/7c23390afd24715fb876f5e0c193b79adf0eeab8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7c23390afd24715fb876f5e0c193b79adf0eeab8\" title=\"Property Setter\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c23390afd24715fb876f5e0c193b79adf0eeab8_2_690x257.png\" alt=\"Property Setter\" data-base62-sha1=\"hIaFATn7gcmMNcnBj84JfFUHPni\" width=\"690\" height=\"257\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c23390afd24715fb876f5e0c193b79adf0eeab8_2_690x257.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c23390afd24715fb876f5e0c193b79adf0eeab8_2_1035x385.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c23390afd24715fb876f5e0c193b79adf0eeab8_2_1380x514.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Property Setter</span><span class=\"informations\">1